		(at 53.21 148.91 90)
		(descr "Coilcraft CST3015 SMT current sense transformer (CST3015-100ED, 1:100, 88A sensed, 5000Vrms reinforced isolation, >=8mm creepage/clearance, AEC-Q200 Grade 1). Land pattern from the official Recommended Land Pattern, Coilcraft Document 1608-2 rev 09/08/25. Primary pads 1/2 9.0x4.8mm on 15.36mm centres; secondary pads 3/4 3.0x4.6mm on 13.76mm centres; rows 18.5mm apart. Body 23.0x30.0mm max. Pad numbering matches the datasheet pins directly (P1/P2=1/2, S1/S2=3/4). Replaced CST2010-100L 2026-07-26: its 47A sensed limit was below the OCP-01 45-55A window.")
